# app: weather
# P7-11: the weather (docs/apps/weather.md). Two places, Thuis (weather.thuis) and Office (weather.office): Google Weather's
# entities, their daily and hourly forecasts and sun.sun from the fixtures (tests/fixtures/make-weather-fixtures.py); today is
# Thursday 15 January 2026, 13:34. Three pages per place: now, today and tomorrow in blocks of three hours, all ten days.
wait 1500
shot weather
expect-state weather=partlycloudy|Updated 13:34|page=1|place=Thuis
# The other place: nothing saved yet, so it is read; the page stays.
tap 390 166
wait 1500
shot weather-office
expect-state weather=cloudy|Updated 13:34|page=1|place=Office
swipe 400 500 100 500
wait 1500
shot weather-office-hours
expect-state page=2|place=Office
# Back to Thuis: its copy is a minute old, no read; still page 2, with the sun's times (sun.sun is the home's sun).
tap 140 166
wait 1500
shot weather-hours
expect-state weather=partlycloudy|Updated 13:34|page=2|place=Thuis
swipe 400 500 100 500
wait 1500
shot weather-days
expect-state page=3
